<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-TOM STEELS WINS FOURTH STAGE OF THE TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOM STEELS WINS FOURTH STAGE OF THE TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>MURCIA, Spain 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tom Steels of Belgium won the 160-km fourth stage of the Tour of Spain from Albacete to Murcia on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Frenchman Laurent Jalabert retained the race leader's yellow jersey.</p>
